  "description": "LESYUH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C61 H93 Dy6 N12 O34 5+,3(H2 O1),5(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.972-3.999 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.79-112.25°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C61H99N12O37Dy6Cl5. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
